    "Brian Chesky did not fire every product manager at Airbnb, but rather restructured the product management function.",
    "The changes made to the product management function at Airbnb included combining inbound product development responsibilities with outbound marketing responsibilities, offboarding program management functions to actual program managers, and making the group smaller and more senior.",
    "Designers cheered at the news of eliminating the product management function because they were frustrated with the product development process, which often treated design as a service organization, and saw the change as an opportunity to break free from this mindset."
